HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The pprroottooccoollss file format appeared in 4.2BSD.

BBUUGGSS
     A name server should be used instead of a static file.  Lines in
     _/_e_t_c_/_p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l_s are limited to BUFSIZ characters (currently 1024).  Longer
     lines will be ignored.

